            "review_title": "Review at Serenata",
            "review_text": "Tim7465\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nOne of tje best restaurants in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam\nJun 2017 • Business\nA great place to meet and eat anytime. Quiet, comfortable, non-smoking and quite pleasant.\n\nThe hot, ginger tea is the best you'll find in any restaurant or coffee shop in town. If you want better, you best stay home and make it yourself.\n\nThe eggs and rice (Trung com op la) is also very good - quite tasty and a favorite of my son.\n\nThe fresh fruit is just that - served in an artful fashion on a white plate with hors d'oeuvre forks.\n\nThe hot tea is a great addition.\nRead more\nWritten June 30, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
